WEBVTT

NOTE Transcript of the narration

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.200
Every big brand starts small,
sometimes with a single carrying pole.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.800
Welcome to Bến Phù Sa, a river town inspired
by the floating markets of the Mekong Delta.

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.441
You run a street-food start-up.

4
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:19.800
Each week, pick a method,
a product and a location.

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.900
After five weeks, the
highest revenue wins.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.990
The carrying pole earns
only a third as much,

7
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.200
but it takes you down every
alley, so you hear everything.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.204
The market boat triples your revenue,

9
00:00:33.204 --> 00:00:36.600
but your product and location
are locked in for the week.

10
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.037
Or skip a week and survey the market.

11
00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:46.100
The data points the right way,
but it may be out of date.

12
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.815
Bánh mì sells fast, chè
bưởi needs careful storage,

13
00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:53.000
cà phê phin pays the most,
but it's slow to brew.

14
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.712
You're not alone. Three AI
rivals work the same market,

15
00:00:58.712 --> 00:01:02.100
and if you land on the same
spot, you split the customers.

16
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.325
Along the way, you'll meet
river-trader traditions:

17
00:01:07.325 --> 00:01:12.000
the hanging pole, the painted
boat eyes, and the vendors' calls.

18
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.192
The secret? Test cheap and fast first.

19
00:01:18.192 --> 00:01:20.600
Once the signal is clear, bet big.

20
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.600
Bến Phù Sa. Play free today.
